---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: Notes from a nurse's journey to financial independence.
showHero: true
---
<section class="blog-index">
  <h1>The Blog</h1>
  <p class="lede">Notes from the floor and from the spreadsheet — one nurse's real path to FI.</p>

  <div class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <a class="post-row" href="{{ post.url }}">
      {% if post.data.image %}
      <span class="post-row-thumb">
        <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="">
      </span>
      {% endif %}
      <span class="post-row-main">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <span class="post-row-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="post-row-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt or (post.templateContent | excerpt(140)) }}</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    {% else %}
    <p>First post is coming soon.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
